{"event_id": "evt_20260506_130236_000_bugfix", "ts": "2026-05-06T13:02:36.607Z", "agent": "CLAUDE", "role": "Systems_Architect", "action_type": "bugfix_applied", "description": "Fixed blank Gemini terminal (5th occurrence). Root cause: fitAddon.fit() was async (rAF ~16ms) so xterm.js was 80x24 when Gemini first drew its TUI at PTY size, causing size mismatch; SIGWINCH from show() 100ms timeout triggered Gemini clear+redraw but if Gemini went idle between clear and draw the screen stayed blank. Fix: (1) terminal.js activate()/create(): synchronous getBoundingClientRect()+fitAddon.fit()+syncSize() immediately after term.open() so xterm.js is correct size before first output; (2) terminal.js activate(): 250ms delayed replay() as safety net; (3) sessions.js create()/spawnChild(): measure #terminal-container rect and compute cols/rows from char metrics (9.6px/19.2px) instead of hardcoded 120x30, so PTY starts at actual terminal size.", "spec_ref": "SPEC-048", "authority": "AI_PROTOCOL.md sec 5 (emergency); prior jurisdiction_exception", "authorized": true, "tier": 3, "escalation": false, "action_data": {"files": ["adt-console/src/js/terminal.js", "adt-console/src/js/sessions.js"], "rebuild_required": false}, "prev_hash": "c40745bc421f68be06ef9d49f96f5f3ecb0f275ca1486f7265ea56d6656eccad", "hash": "db1c5569afc0dbd4b2f23334ddd041dfa4ec40576a165c14db1c4e5922a537dd"}
